Description:
    Generates a reactive CRUD resource for a model that ALREADY exists — the
    overlay half of hibiki:rails:scaffold.

    With no field list the model's own schema is read: columns and types,
    belongs_to reflections, and the validators behind per-field live errors.
    Pass fields explicitly to override that, or when the table has not been
    migrated yet.

    The generated index is live: search, filter, sort and pagination are signal
    state, edits happen in place, and a write from anywhere repaints every open
    list. The model is MODIFIED — one delegate per belongs_to, plus the
    after_commit broadcast the whole thing hangs off.

Example:
    bin/rails generate hibiki:rails:scaffold_controller Book

    This will create:
        app/models/book_query.rb
        app/models/book_row.rb
        app/channels/books_channel.rb
        app/channels/book_channel.rb
        app/forms/book_form.rb
        app/controllers/books_controller.rb
        app/views/books/*
    And modify:
        app/models/book.rb
        config/routes.rb
